					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					988
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				837
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι γάρ με παρήϊξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.615
				</span></i>
			: in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.774f
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>]</div>
